    "Playing lifts happiness and spends a little fullness and energy. A tired pet can still play, but earns 25% fewer performance coins. Food and items never expire, and there are no paid currencies." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the arcade economy.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing lifts happiness and spends a little fullness and energy. A tired pet can still play, but earns 25% fewer performance coins. Food and items never expire, and there are no paid currencies."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Игры радуют питомца, но немного расходуют сытость и энергию. Уставший питомец может играть, но получает на 25% меньше монет за результат. Еда и предметы хранятся бессрочно. Платной валюты нет."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Playroom" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
